# Template -- copy to remote_subdirs.txt and add your own folders:
#   cp remote_subdirs.txt.example remote_subdirs.txt
#
# One line = one sub-folder under remote_dir (recursive).
# Lines starting with # are comments. Missing or empty file = show ALL folders.
#
# Example:
# Urlaub2023
# Familie
# Feiern/Hochzeit
